- [ ] A publication date without `confirmedFromScan: true` renders at its confirmed precision with a note; a confirmed fixture shows the day.
- [ ] Coverage indicators show separate dimensions from the coverage ledger, and no aggregate score.
- [ ] Batch B entry path, on the fixture corpus:
